WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
A Unitree G1 robot stands beside a padded incline. A safety tether connects its upper body to a gantry; an operator holds the gantry controller.

00:02.000 --> 00:07.000
The robot steps onto the padded surface and bends its torso forward, lowering a handheld tool toward the surface. The operator and tether remain visible.

00:07.000 --> 00:09.000
The robot straightens its torso and returns toward an upright stance.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
The tether becomes taut and the gantry lifts the robot during the reset. This is a supervised laboratory trial, shown at original speed without sound.
